0:{"buildId":"IYfpmMc1rPsupOCyyuFTX","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"terms-module__tZIRGq__wrap","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"terms-module__tZIRGq__panel","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/","className":"terms-module__tZIRGq__back","children":"â† Back"}],["$","article",null,{"className":"terms-module__tZIRGq__prose","children":[["$","h1","h1-0",{"children":"Privacy Policy"}],"\n",["$","p","p-0",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Last updated:"}]," April 12, 2026"]}],"\n",["$","p","p-1",{"children":"This Privacy Policy describes how we handle personal information when you use the Haiku generation service (the site, app, and related features). We keep collection limited to what we need to run the product, support accounts, and understand usage at a basic level."}],"\n",["$","p","p-2",{"children":"If you do not agree with this Policy, please do not use the Haiku generation service."}],"\n",["$","p","p-3",{"children":"We may update this Policy from time to time. When we do, we will change the â€œLast updatedâ€ date above. For meaningful changes, we may also notify you through the Haiku generation service or by email where appropriate."}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-0",{}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-0",{"children":"1. Who we are"}],"\n",["$","p","p-4",{"children":"The Haiku generation service is operated by an independent developer. For privacy requests, use the contact method described at the end of this Policy."}],"\n",["$","hr","hr-1",{}],"\n",["$","h2","h2-1",{"children":"2. What information we collect"}],"\n",["$","p","p-5",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Account and authentication."}]," If you sign up or log in, we typically collect information such as your email address, and data needed to maintain your session or verify your identity (for example, tokens or identifiers associated with your account). If you use a third-party sign-in provider, we receive whatever profile details that provider shares with us according to your choices and their policies."]}],"\n",["$","p","p-6",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Usage and technical data."}]," We may collect basic information about how you use the Haiku generation service, such as pages or features accessed, approximate timestamps, and diagnostic data that helps us fix errors or improve performance. This is generally aggregated or logged at a level that supports operations rather than detailed profiling."]}],"\n",["$","p","p-7",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Content you provide."}]," If you submit text, preferences, or other content to the Haiku generation service, we store and process it as needed to provide the features you use."]}],"\n",["$","p","p-8",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Payments."}]," We do not receive or store your full payment card details on our own systems. Purchases are processed by ",["$","strong","strong-1",{"children":"Paddle"}],", which acts as ",["$","strong","strong-2",{"children":"merchant of record"}],". Paddle collects payment information and billing details required to complete a transaction. We may receive limited information from Paddle or from our own records, such as whether a purchase succeeded, product or plan identifiers, and enough detail to provide access you paid for."]}],"\n",["$","p","p-9",{"children":[["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"Communications."}]," If you contact us, we keep the content of your message and related metadata (such as your email address) so we can respond."]}],"\n",["$","p","p-10",{"children":"We do not intentionally collect sensitive categories of data (such as health information) as part of the Haiku generation service. Please do not send us such information unless a feature explicitly requires it and we describe that separately."}],"\n","$L3","\n","$L4","\n","$L5","\n","$L6","\n","$L7","\n","$L8","\n","$L9","\n","$La","\n","$Lb","\n","$Lc","\n","$Ld","\n","$Le","\n","$Lf","\n","$